{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昨日（26日）BLACKPINK成員Jennie現身在首爾舉行的CHANEL（香奈兒）2026高級手工坊系列復刻大秀。更在大秀結束後的After Party上，首度公開表演未發布的全新單曲。</p><figure><img alt=\"Jennie身穿銀色外套、火辣紅Bra Top亮相After Party。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136291926765604864280594.jpeg/FQ6LCD9ZTf45MJGlrGR0sZQ1Gwyh3BHttT_WjrU_1o4\"/><figcaption>Jennie身穿銀色外套、火辣紅Bra Top亮相After Party。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>火辣紅Bra表演極致誘惑</p><p>Jennie身穿銀色外套、火辣紅Bra Top與超短裙驚艷亮相After Party。期間唱了《Handlebars》、《Like Jennie》等四首大熱單曲。在唱到興起時更將外套脫掉，大騷骨感身材與纖腰！並在期間首度公開表演未發布的全新單曲，新歌融合Afro與電子風格，Jennie在台上瘋狂扭腰、抖臀，更有跪姿與挑逗性舞蹈動作，火辣程度爆錶。</p><figure><img alt=\"表演新歌。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136291924395692032813692.png/K8SuIqGPSd2D4vX02ajw6oGP-dETh305Xo52zF6Odsw\"/><figcaption>表演新歌。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jennie好sexy。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136291937708412928461830.png/qUSeQY8f4OtTdJi1mn9GL9cMDVOzU4KxdT5aLHU-Wiw\"/><figcaption>Jennie好sexy。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"抖臀。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136291942611816448263510.png/MJEMtKa1vBV7CxAI8KNkPD3Pr2nwTKPcYvRD5WL0Q-U\"/><figcaption>抖臀。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"跪地。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136316970874966016157386.png/EnX0Ei6s9W6kv3rh8CWGqMhhhqhqSf-kEo1rbBKNa2w\"/><figcaption>跪地。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jennie新歌歌詞引網民熱議。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136317262874021888756804.jpeg/3TGeKD2RSwvMJ28yaREXZkDrNLfOyiavPvJWaz7yVms\"/><figcaption>Jennie新歌歌詞引網民熱議。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jennie新歌歌詞引網民熱議。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136329883455066112815320.jpeg/18UgUpnMffiLOFh-K_Kgr6jy8eq5dGlEPHky3jx5Mt4\"/><figcaption>Jennie新歌歌詞引網民熱議。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>動作挑逗遭轟低俗不雅觀</p><p>雖然舞台效果震撼，但極具視覺衝擊的演出卻引來兩極爭議。有現場觀眾指出新歌歌詞含有直白情慾暗示，痛批內容「露骨」兼「低俗」。而Jennie的舞蹈動作亦被質疑「不雅觀」，不少網民直言她「將私人曖昧場景搬至公開高端場合」，與高級時裝品牌形象顯得格格不入。</p><figure><img alt=\"Jennie大騷美背。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136311865253564416498230.jpeg/8emi4gLnTuGigxLscqi-uFdmJd3dm1XPYBeEpGAXhKQ\"/><figcaption>Jennie大騷美背。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jennie遭網民轟低俗不雅。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136291944864288768794180.png/bhrfjRSk9AWZC_O8hpp8lg5poEYzV_ns0AXO8NAFzvA\"/><figcaption>Jennie遭網民轟低俗不雅。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T15:40:20.525822+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":601,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}